# Nothing here is generated by the plugin itself: `lib/` is hand-written, and
# `preview/prose-style.html` is a checked-in artifact so its diff shows when the
# stylesheet changes.

# OS and editor junk
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*~
*.swp

# Scratch output from the bundling helpers
*.tmp
*.log

# A local `npm install` inside the plugin would create this; the profile owns
# the real link.
node_modules/
